   * Verified sigmoid showcase (post 28): sampled points + the
   * engine-serialized MathML formula. Thin delegations -- found
   * missing by the 2026-08-08 hub_browser_all.sh sweep (same masked
   * fn-surface class as the rhoDf* gaps above).
