   * the OWL-RL closure, the pure verified chain bin/owl-runner runs
   * under `--regime dl`. `data` may be raw RDF text (parsed with
   * `options.format`, default "turtle") or an FnDataset. `consistent`
   * is true|false|null (null = budget-out, `reason` names the fuel cap
